# The generated C header is compared byte for byte against a fresh cbindgen run
# by `geopackage-ffi/tests/c_smoke.rs`. cbindgen writes LF, so keep it LF in the
# working tree on every platform rather than letting a Windows checkout rewrite
# it. The test normalises line endings as well, so this is belt and braces.
*.h text eol=lf
*.c text eol=lf
